      "text": "## The Deregulation Story: FERC Orders 888 and 889 (1996)"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-MARKETS.md#007",
      "path": [
        "08-MARKETS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:electrical-grid:08-markets, git-history:electrical-grid:08-markets]",
